"Users can manage synchronization and activity-tracking features in the\n      app, delete their account in the account controls, and opt out of SMS by\n      replying STOP. See the" = "使用者可以在 App 中管理同步和活動追蹤功能、在帳戶控制項中刪除帳戶，並透過回覆 STOP 取消訂閱 SMS。請參閱";
"Users may submit feedback anonymously or choose to attach it to their\n      signed-in account. XTimers stores the feedback text and operational\n      metadata needed to review the request, prevent abuse, and respond or fix\n      problems. Anonymous feedback is not attached to an account identifier,\n      although ordinary network request metadata may still be recorded." = "使用者可以匿名提交意見回饋，或選擇將其附加到已登入的帳戶。XTimers 會儲存檢查要求、防止濫用以及回應或修正問題所需的意見回饋文字與操作中繼資料。匿名意見回饋不會附加至帳戶識別碼，但一般網路要求的中繼資料仍可能被記錄。";
"Users opt in inside the Flexible Timers app by entering their phone number\n      and affirmatively checking a box that is not pre-selected. The checkbox\n      says: \"I agree to receive SMS verification codes and reminder messages\n      from Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC that I schedule for myself at this\n      phone number.\" The opt-in screen also displays these SMS Terms, the\n      Privacy Policy, standard message and data rate disclosure, STOP and HELP\n      instructions, message frequency information, and no-marketing language.\n      Consent is not a condition of purchase.\n      See the opt-in evidence page at" = "使用者在 Flexible Timers 應用程式中輸入電話號碼，並主動勾選預設\n      未勾選的核取方塊，即表示選擇加入。核取方塊文字為：「我同意接收\n      來自 Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC 的 SMS 驗證碼，以及我在此電話號碼上\n      為自己安排的提醒訊息。」選擇加入畫面也會顯示這些 SMS 條款、\n      隱私權政策、標準訊息和資料費率說明、STOP 和 HELP 說明、訊息頻率\n      資訊以及非行銷說明。同意不是購買條件。\n      請參閱選擇加入證據頁面：";
"Website Analytics" = "網站分析";
"When the user enables automatic activity tracking, XTimers records\n      application activity on the user's Mac. Website-hostname tracking is\n      available only in the separately distributed XTimers Pro edition\n      (downloaded from xintechllc.com, not the App Store); it never applies to\n      the App Store edition. The underlying activity log is maintained on the\n      device and is not continuously uploaded. If the user explicitly emails or\n      publishes an activity report, the selected report content, including\n      application names (and, in XTimers Pro, website hostnames) shown in that\n      report, is sent to XTimers' service to perform the requested action." = "當使用者啟用自動活動追蹤時，XTimers 會記錄使用者 Mac 上的 App 活動。網站主機名稱追蹤只在另行發行的 XTimers Pro 版本中提供（從 xintechllc.com 下載，而非 App Store），絕不適用於 App Store 版本。底層活動記錄保留在裝置上，不會持續上傳。如果使用者明確以電子郵件傳送或發佈活動報告，所選報告內容（包括報告中顯示的 App 名稱，以及 XTimers Pro 中的網站主機名稱）會傳送到 XTimers 服務，以執行所要求的操作。";
"When the user turns on the Personal Calendar Overlay and grants permission,\n      XTimers reads events from the calendars the user selects in Apple Calendar,\n      including any iCloud, Google, Outlook, or subscribed calendars already\n      configured there. XTimers does not connect to those calendar providers\n      directly and never requests their account credentials; Apple Calendar\n      continues to synchronize them under the user's own settings.\n      Event details are read on the device to display them and are not uploaded\n      to XTimers' service. XTimers stores only the user's on/off choice, the\n      identifiers of the calendars selected on that installation, and a record\n      of which privacy explanation was acknowledged. XTimers never creates,\n      edits, or deletes events in the user's calendars." = "當使用者開啟「個人行事曆疊加顯示」並授予權限時，XTimers 會讀取使用者在「行事曆」App 中所選行事曆的行程，包括已在該 App 中設定的 iCloud、Google、Outlook 或訂閱的行事曆。XTimers 不會直接連接這些行事曆供應商，也絕不會要求其帳號憑證；「行事曆」App 會繼續依照使用者自己的設定進行同步。系統會在裝置上讀取行程詳細資訊以供顯示，這些資訊不會上傳到 XTimers 服務。XTimers 只會儲存使用者的開啟/關閉選擇、在這次安裝中所選行事曆的識別碼，以及已確認之隱私權說明版本的記錄。XTimers 絕不會在使用者的行事曆中建立、編輯或刪除行程。";
"Wireless carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages." = "無線電信業者不對延遲或未送達的訊息負責。";
"XTimers" = "XTimers";
"XTimers Privacy Choices" = "XTimers 隱私選項";
"XTimers Support" = "XTimers 支援";
"XTimers app screenshots" = "XTimers App 螢幕截圖";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC Privacy Policy" = "由 Xintech LLC 營運的 XTimers 隱私權政策";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC SMS is limited to account phone\n      verification codes and user-created reminder SMS sent only to the\n      signed-in user's own verified, opted-in account phone number. Reply STOP\n      to opt out of SMS messages. Reply HELP for help. Reply START or YES to\n      opt back in after consenting in the app. SMS is not a two-way chat\n      service." = "由 Xintech LLC 營運的 XTimers SMS 僅限帳戶電話號碼驗證碼和使用者建立的提醒 SMS，而且只會傳送到已登入使用者本人已驗證且已選擇接收的帳戶電話號碼。回覆 STOP 可取消訂閱 SMS 訊息。回覆 HELP 可取得協助。在 App 中授權後，回覆 START 或 YES 可重新選擇接收。SMS 不是雙向聊天服務。";
"XTimers currently sends email reports, verification messages, and\n      user-created reminders only to the signed-in user's own account email\n      address. SMS is sent only to the user's own verified, opted-in account\n      phone number. XTimers may process message content, delivery status,\n      scheduled time, and provider response metadata to deliver and troubleshoot\n      these messages." = "XTimers 目前只會將電子郵件報告、驗證訊息和使用者建立的提醒，傳送到已登入使用者本人的帳戶電子郵件地址。SMS 只會傳送到使用者本人已驗證且已選擇接收的帳戶電話號碼。XTimers 可能會處理訊息內容、傳送狀態、排程時間和提供者回應中繼資料，以傳送這些訊息並排解相關問題。";
"XTimers does not use the collected app data to track users across apps or\n      websites owned by other companies for advertising. Xintech LLC does not\n      sell SMS opt-in data or other app data. Xintech LLC does not share SMS\n      opt-in data, phone numbers, or text-message consent with third parties or\n      affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes." = "XTimers 不會使用所收集的 App 資料跨其他公司擁有的 App 或網站追蹤使用者以投放廣告。Xintech LLC 不會出售 SMS 選擇接收資料或其他 App 資料。Xintech LLC 不會基於行銷或宣傳目的，與第三方或關係企業分享 SMS 選擇接收資料、電話號碼或簡訊授權資訊。";
"XTimers email reports and email messages are currently limited to the\n      signed-in user's own account email address." = "XTimers 的電子郵件報告和電子郵件訊息目前只會傳送到已登入使用者本人的帳戶電子郵件地址。";
