"XTimers is a calm Apple-native timer workspace for timers, countdowns, clocks, task sets, reports, custom sounds, and account reminders across Mac, iPhone, and iPad." = "XTimers 是適用於 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 的 Apple 原生計時工作區，支援計時器、倒數、時鐘、任務集、報告、自訂聲音與帳號提醒。";
"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC. For product support, bug\n      reports, account questions, or SMS help, email us at" = "XTimers 由 Xintech LLC 營運。如需產品支援、回報錯誤、詢問帳戶問題或取得 SMS 協助，請傳送電子郵件至";
"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC. This policy explains the information\n      XTimers processes when providing timers, countdowns, activity tracking,\n      accounts, synchronization, reports, custom sounds, reminders, support,\n      and messaging features." = "XTimers 由 Xintech LLC 營運。本政策說明 XTimers 在提供計時器、倒數、活動追蹤、帳戶、同步、報告、自訂聲音、提醒、支援和訊息功能時所處理的資訊。";
"XTimers macOS add countdown sheet in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 新增倒數表單";
"XTimers macOS add timer sheet in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 新增計時器表單";
"XTimers macOS expanded double-column timer window" = "XTimers macOS 展開的雙欄計時器視窗";
"XTimers macOS main timer window in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 主計時器視窗";
"XTimers may process a per-installation device identifier, push-notification\n      token, platform, app version, build number, operating-system version,\n      device model, service command or feature interaction, response status,\n      response duration, and error information. These records are used to\n      provide synchronization and notifications, operate the service, measure\n      feature use, diagnose failures, improve performance, and prevent abuse." = "XTimers 可能會處理每次安裝的裝置識別碼、推播通知權杖、平台、App 版本、建置編號、作業系統版本、裝置型號、服務指令或功能互動、回應狀態、回應時間和錯誤資訊。這些記錄用於提供同步與通知、營運服務、衡量功能使用情況、診斷故障、改善效能並防止濫用。";
"XTimers platforms" = "XTimers 平台";
"XTimers receives the IP address and user-agent information used to connect\n      to its service. For security, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and\n      service administration, the service may retain the IP address, a derived\n      IP key, approximate country, region, city, postal area, network\n      organization, request time, command name, and a stable hashed account\n      identifier for authenticated requests. The app also submits Apple\n      MetricKit diagnostic payloads that can contain crash, hang, CPU, disk,\n      energy, and other performance or technical information." = "XTimers 會接收用來連接其服務的 IP 位址和 User-Agent 資訊。基於安全性、疑難排解、防止濫用和服務管理，服務可能會保留 IP 位址、衍生 IP 金鑰、大致的國家、地區、城市、郵遞區域、網路組織、要求時間、指令名稱，以及用於已驗證要求的穩定雜湊帳戶識別碼。App 也會提交 Apple MetricKit 診斷承載資料，其中可能包含當機、停滯、CPU、磁碟、能源以及其他效能或技術資訊。";
"XTimers — Mac, iPhone, and iPad" = "XTimers — Mac、iPhone 與 iPad";
"Xintech LLC uses administrative, technical, and organizational measures\n      intended to protect XTimers information. No storage or transmission system\n      can be guaranteed to be completely secure." = "Xintech LLC 採用管理、技術和組織措施來保護 XTimers 資訊。任何儲存或傳輸系統都無法保證絕對安全。";
"Xintech LLC uses service providers for cloud hosting and storage, email and\n      SMS delivery, push notifications, diagnostics, and website analytics.\n      These providers may process information only as needed to perform services\n      for Xintech LLC, subject to their applicable terms and privacy safeguards.\n      Email and SMS providers receive the recipient, requested message content,\n      and delivery metadata needed to send the user's message." = "Xintech LLC 使用服務提供者提供雲端代管與儲存、電子郵件與 SMS 傳送、推播通知、診斷和網站分析。這些提供者只能在為 Xintech LLC 提供服務所需的範圍內處理資訊，並受其適用條款與隱私保護措施約束。電子郵件和 SMS 提供者會收到傳送使用者訊息所需的收件人、要求傳送的訊息內容和傳送中繼資料。";
